      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَسَ</span></b> , (K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبُسَ</span></b> , (TK,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبْسٌ</span>; (TA;)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبِسَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَسَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَسٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُبْسَةٌ</span>; (IKtt,

TA;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَغْبَسَ</span></b> , (K,) in some copies of the
K, erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِغْبَسَّ</span>; (TA;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِغْبَاسَّ</span></b> ;
(As, K;) <i>It</i> (the night, TA) <i>was,</i> or <i>became,
dark.</i> (K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبِشَ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَسَ وَجْهَهُ</span> <i>He
